<title>USA: Prentiss Properties sets initial dividend.</title>
<headline>Prentiss Properties sets initial dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prentiss Properties Trust said it has declared an initial cash dividend of $0.31 per share for the fourth quarter to be paid January 17 to owners of record December 31.</p>
<p>The company said it will announce its next dividend the third week of March.</p>
